# Command words the payload may use that are not busybox applets in the
# printer's rootfs. Each one must be justified: either the mod ships it, or a
# firmware package installs it onto /usr/prog.
#
# Anything added here without one of those two reasons is a boot failure
# waiting to happen -- test/test-applets.py exists to force this review.
#
# The list is EMPTY, and that is the healthy state. It used to name
# helix-screen, nginx, python3, klipperDaemon and five others, none of which
# test-applets.py had asked about for a long time: the payload reaches all of
# them through an absolute path (/usr/prog/nginx/sbin/nginx) or a variable
# ($NGINX, $FF_PY), and neither form is a bare command word. Nine entries that
# excused nothing read like nine commands under review, so they are gone.
#
# Add a line here only when test-applets.py actually names a word, and say
# which of the two reasons above covers it.
